# Data directory internal .gitignore
# This file manages ignore rules inside the data directory
# Root .gitignore handles the main exclusion patterns

# Ignore everything in data directory by default
*

# But keep these structure files
!.gitkeep
!.gitignore

# Keep audits directory structure
!audits/
audits/*
!audits/.gitkeep

# Note: All generated data files are excluded via root .gitignore
# This includes: *.db, *.sqlite, *.sqlite3, *.json, *.csv, *.md, etc.